  "implemented": [
    "Collapsed per-worksheet item chooser searches mapped item names, serial and part numbers, filters All/Included/Excluded/Needs review and paginates at 50 rows.",
    "Explicit include/exclude controls apply to individual rows or the current displayed page only. Searching, filtering and paging leave choices and approval unchanged; excluded rows remain available to restore.",
    "Full mapped TSV and full original source-row references remain paired. Optional selected_rows uses strict unique one-based mapped positions; default absence preserves legacy all-row imports.",
    "Selections preserve original source_id, reviewed_row and Excel source_row positions rather than renumbering the filtered set. Repeated SN/PN on distinct source rows remain separate.",
    "Mapped/included/excluded per-sheet totals distinguish item records from stock quantity. Zero remains zero, blank quantity remains Unknown, missing identifiers remain optional and source Counted values remain notes.",
    "Manually exclude previously imported original source rows, then check again to add only selected new rows to an existing permitted inventory. Conflict review and final all-or-nothing save guards remain.",
    "Changing choices clears review/request/confirmation. Pending/uncertain saves freeze selection controls and retain identical operation receipts; current access, destination-version refresh, departed route/account and old verification/task/custody protections remain.",
    "Mapping changes carry exclusions only by confirmed original Excel row matches; otherwise visible reset guidance requires reviewing choices. Manual full-text edits reset positional selection and typed original references.",
    "Manual headerless/current-header/legacy-header TSV interpretation now agrees with backend row positions. Remapping updates provenance notices, and chooser redraws preserve keyboard focus without scrolling.",
    "Selected children with excluded required parent boxes produce a located worksheet and source/mapped row error; no implicit reparenting or hierarchy inference.",
    "Updated import help is inside the existing content chapters; importer assets and shell cache are versioned UI105. Prior checklist/maintenance/toolbox/logbook/email/recovery workflows remain included."
  ],
